  "details": "It would be incredibly useful to have a Friends List Cleaner or bulk unfriend tool in VRChat. This feature would allow users to quickly remove all friends who are not on their Favorites list, instead of manually unfriending each person one by one.\n\nWhy this is needed:\n\nOver time, friends lists can become cluttered with people you no longer talk to or even recognize. Currently, there's no easy way to manage this beyond individually removing users, which is time-consuming and frustrating for people with large lists.\n\nSuggested features:\n\nOption to automatically unfriend anyone not in a Favorites group\n\nFilters to sort or select users based on:\n\nLast online time\n\nLast world visited together\n\nDate added\n\nPreview of who will be removed before confirming\n\nOptional backup/export of removed users' names, in case you want to reconnect later\n\nThis would give users more control over their social space and improve the overall social experience in VRChat.",
